    "text": "COMPLIANCE:\nScene ID: SC_001_002\nAllowed events: Rhea is pinned, UI demands indenture acceptance, passive heat damage ticks, Rhea reads fine print, dismisses prompt, avoids rock pillar, escapes debris.\nForbidden milestones: None explicitly marked NOT_YET.\n\nCurrent arm-side / inventory facts: \n- inventory: char_rhea -> Cracked Smartphone (status=stowed, container=blazer_pocket_right)\n- container: blazer_pocket_right (owner=char_rhea, contents=[ITEM_cracked_smartphone])\n\nDurable changes committed: \n- Pinned status removed.\n- Stamina reduced by 1.\n- Added Bruised Left Leg mark.\n- Removed injury: pinned under heavy obsidian debris.\n- Added injury: bruised left leg.\n\nAPPEARANCE_CHECK:\n- char_rhea: late twenties, slender, female, human, dark brown eyes, black messy bob, pale skin, System Indenture Brand on left wrist.\n\nPROSE:\nRhea gritted her teeth, her lungs fighting for air beneath the jagged obsidian debris that kept her pinned to the scorched earth. She couldn't even assess the damage to her trapped left leg, because a glowing blue notification hung exactly two inches from her nose, keeping her vision entirely blocked.\n\n[Indenture Status: Pending Registration]\n[Soul Debt Assessed: 100,000 Credits]\n[Acknowledge terms to receive Standard Frontier Starter Pack and immediate Medical Relief.]\n[Accept] | [Accept (Expedited)]\n\nThere was no 'Decline' button. Of course there wasn't.\n\nA secondary window blinked into existence at the edge of her peripheral vision, pulsing with an angry red border.\n\n[Warning: Environmental Hazard \u2014 Ashen Drop Zone]\n[Passive Heat Damage: -1 HP / 15s]\n[Time until initial damage tick: 12s...]\n\nRhea flicked her eyes to her own health bar, which hovered in the upper left corner of her vision like a sick joke.\n\n[HP: 1/100]\n\nTwelve seconds until the ambient temperature literally cooked the last hit point out of her body. \n\n\"Come on,\" she wheezed, her voice cracking from the dry, sulfurous air. She tried to swipe the main notification away, but her ash-covered fingers passed right through the holographic projection. It was eye-tracking.\n\n[Time until initial damage tick: 08s...]\n\nShe forced her eyes to focus on the microscopic text crawling along the very bottom edge of the blue box. The fine print. \n\n*By clicking Accept, the Indentured Soul agrees to a 45% daily compounding interest rate on all outstanding debt, waives all rights to physical autonomy, and consents to biological liquidation in the event of default.*\n\n[Time until initial damage tick: 04s...]\n\n\"Not today, you bureaucratic nightmare,\" she muttered. She scanned the very bottom line. Nestled right next to the System version number and copyright date was a single, grayed-out word: *Dismiss*.\n\nShe focused her gaze on it, blinking hard to select it.\n\n[Indenture Prompt Dismissed. Manual Onboarding selected.]\n[Tutorial Grace Period protocol updated. Local environmental hazards suppressed.]\n[Passive Heat Damage: Cancelled.]\n\nThe glowing blue text shattered into a shower of digital sparks, instantly clearing her field of view. \n\nThe relief lasted a fraction of a second. Without the UI blocking her vision, Rhea could clearly see the massive, fractured rock pillar directly above her. A deep fissure snapped up its center, and the entire structure groaned, tilting downward. \n\nIt was collapsing.\n\nAdrenaline flooded her system. Rhea dug her hands into the hot ash and violently yanked her body backward. The Cracked Smartphone stowed in her right blazer pocket dug painfully into her hip, but she ignored it, twisting her torso and dragging her bruised left leg out from under the shifting rubble. \n\nShe rolled across the smoking ground just as the obsidian pillar slammed into the exact spot where her head had been, throwing up a choking cloud of gray dust and razor-sharp shrapnel. \n\nRhea lay flat on her back, coughing up ash as she stared at the empty, bruised sky. \n\n[Status Effect: Pinned removed.]\n\nShe was alive. Broke, battered, and stranded in a wasteland, but alive. And she hadn't signed a damn thing.\n\nSTATE_PATCH:\n```json\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"world_updates\": {\n    \"cast_present\": [\n      \"char_rhea\"\n    ],\n    \"location\": \"LOC_TUTORIAL_WASTELAND_DROP_ZONE\"\n  },\n  \"character_updates\": [\n    {\n      \"character_id\": \"char_rhea\",\n      \"chapter\": 1,\n      \"scene\": 2,\n      \"inventory\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": \"ITEM_cracked_smartphone\",\n          \"container\": \"blazer_pocket_right\",\n          \"status\": \"stowed\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"containers\": [\n        {\n          \"container\": \"blazer_pocket_right\",\n          \"owner\": \"char_rhea\",\n          \"contents\": [\n            \"ITEM_cracked_smartphone\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"appearance_updates\": {\n        \"set\": {\n          \"marks_add\": [\n            {\n              \"name\": \"Bruised Left Leg\",\n              \"location\": \"left leg\",\n              \"durability\": \"durable\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"reason\": \"Leg was pinned under heavy obsidian debris.\"\n      },\n      \"invariants_add\": [],\n      \"persona_updates\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"character_continuity_system_updates\": [\n    {\n      \"character_id\": \"char_rhea\",\n      \"remove\": {\n        \"statuses\": [\n          \"Pinned\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"delta\": {\n        \"stats\": {\n          \"stamina\": {\n            \"current\": -1\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"reason\": \"Escaped the debris and used stamina to roll away.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary_update\": {\n    \"last_scene\": [\n      \"Rhea woke up pinned under obsidian debris, her vision blocked by a glowing System notification demanding she accept her Indenture Status.\",\n      \"Facing imminent death from passive heat damage, she read the fine print and found a hidden option to dismiss the predatory contract.\",\n      \"Clearing her vision just in time, she rolled away from a collapsing rock pillar, surviving the trap with exactly 1 HP.\"\n    ],\n    \"key_events\": [\n      \"Rhea was trapped under obsidian debris with a System prompt blocking her view.\",\n      \"A passive heat damage timer threatened to drain her final hit point in 12 seconds.\",\n      \"Rhea refused the default terms and found a hidden 'Dismiss' button in the fine print.\",\n      \"Dismissing the prompt canceled the environmental damage and cleared her vision.\",\n      \"Rhea rolled away from a collapsing rock pillar, freeing her trapped leg and removing the Pinned status.\"\n    ],\n    \"must_stay_true\": [\n      \"REMOVE: injury: char_rhea pinned under heavy obsidian debris\",\n      \"REMOVE: mechanic: char_rhea has active status Pinned\",\n      \"inventory: char_rhea -> Cracked Smartphone (status=stowed, container=blazer_pocket_right)\",\n      \"container: blazer_pocket_right (owner=char_rhea, contents=[ITEM_cracked_smartphone])\",\n      \"injury: char_rhea bruised left leg\",\n      \"mechanic: char_rhea HP is 1/100\",\n      \"mechanic: char_rhea has active status Tutorial Grace Period\",\n      \"mechanic: char_rhea has active title Indentured Soul\",\n      \"mechanic: char_rhea has 100,000 Soul Debt\"\n    ],\n    \"chapter_so_far_add\": []\n  }\n}\n```",
